-#
  TRK-05, BR-20: for how many months car positions are kept, as the page
  Settings holds it. The map's own 30 days are named, so that nobody takes
  them for the period.
%section.tracking-setup{ aria: { labelledby: "tracking-kept-title" } }
  %h2#tracking-kept-title How long car positions are kept
  %p
    Car positions are kept for #{tag.strong("#{setting.position_months} months")}; every night at 03:30 the older ones
    are deleted.
  %p.note.kept-now
    - if oldest
      Kept now: positions since #{tag.strong(l(oldest))}.
    - else
      No position is kept yet.
  %p.note
    The main map shows a car at its last position of the last #{CarPosition::SHOWN.in_days.to_i} days; older positions
    stay kept and are not shown.
  %p.note= link_to "Change the period in Settings", settings_path
